WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.200
Trump says Governor J.B. Pritzker and Mayor Brandon Johnson should be in jail.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.520
ICE officers' lives are in danger in Chicago, and at this point, they're aiding and abetting

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.280
an insurrection.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.880
This is nothing more than sabotage and a dereliction of duty.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:20.280
But the mayor says Trump's just trying to lock up another brother.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:27.440
It's certainly not the first time that Donald Trump has called for the arresting of a black

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.680
man, unjustly.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:30.680
I'm not going anywhere.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.480
I'm going to stay firm.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:33.919
Johnson's not very bright.

00:00:33.919 --> 00:00:36.820
Trump also wants to lock up the white guy.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:39.320
But the white guy's building a wall.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:46.240
This is a convicted felon, I mean, think about that, who is threatening to jail me.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:52.439
I got to say, this guy's unhinged, he's insecure, he's a wannabe dictator, and there's one thing

00:00:52.439 --> 00:00:58.000
I really want to say to Donald Trump, if you come for my people, you come through me.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.320
So come and get me.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.320
Jamie Back's big, but he's not that big.

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:04.120
How's ribs going to stop a chopper?

